MATCH_BEGIN docs/NegRiskAdapter.md LINES 74 78
LINE 74 The user must hold at least `_amount` of each NO token.
LINE 75 
LINE 76 If the market has `n` questions, and the user converts `_amount` of `m` NO tokens, the user receive `_amount * (m-1)` collateral and `_amount` each of the complimentary YES tokens.
LINE 77 
LINE 78 Supposing that exactly one questions resolves true, these two positions have equivalent final values. In the event that all questions resolve false, the resulting position is worth _less_ than the original position. It is not possible for more than one question to resolve true.
MATCH_END
