FUNCTION_LINE # NegRiskAdapter
FUNCTION_LINE 
FUNCTION_LINE `NegRiskAdapter` provides an adapter interface for the Gnosis Conditional Tokens Framework (CTF) which allows users to _convert_ collections of NO tokens in mutually-exclusive binary markets into a corresponding position of YES tokens and collateral.
FUNCTION_LINE 
FUNCTION_LINE In this contract, _markets_ refer to collections of mutually-exclusive binary conditions, and _questions_ (or their corresponding _positions_) refer to the invidual conditions themselves.
