FUNCTION_LINE The user must hold at least `_amount` of each NO token.
FUNCTION_LINE 
FUNCTION_LINE If the market has `n` questions, and the user converts `_amount` of `m` NO tokens, the user receive `_amount * (m-1)` collateral and `_amount` each of the complimentary YES tokens.
FUNCTION_LINE 
FUNCTION_LINE Supposing that exactly one questions resolves true, these two positions have equivalent final values. In the event that all questions resolve false, the resulting position is worth _less_ than the original position. It is not possible for more than one question to resolve true.
